# Outreach material must never enter this public repository.
# It contains personal data (names, institutional emails, h-index) collected for
# a specific academic purpose, and the scripts that collect it. It normally lives
# outside this repo; these rules are a backstop against a stray copy.
outreach/
outreach*/
**/outreach/
pi_outreach*.csv
crawl_raw*.csv
outreach_candidates*.csv
outreach_shortlist*.csv
crawl_epmc.py
add_full_names.py
add_openalex.py
add_s2.py
rank_outreach.py
make_final.py
email_template.md
linkedin_posts.md

# Anything that looks like a harvested contact list
*contacts*.csv
*emails*.csv
*_pi_*.csv
*mailing*.csv

# Private curation notes and manuscript drafts (per CONTRIBUTING.md)
notes/
private/
*.docx
